      "content": "You mention that technical skill and mastery are \"essential components of art's enduring value.\" If an artist creates a piece that is highly effective at driving political change but lacks those traditional skills or aesthetic qualities, would you say that piece has ultimately failed as art? Or is the political impact enough to make it successful?",
